{"id":"n90938-3-7","stage":4,"title":"떨구다 · 掉","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n90938-3-7-1","ko":"어디에서 전화기를 잃어버렸니?","zh":"你在哪里弄丢手机了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어디에서","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디에서","audio":"/audio/b7f2498da0de7d9f1c85.mp3"}},{"text":"전화기를","meaning":"电话机","explanation":"전화기：电话机；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"전화기","audio":"/audio/920d2edb729250383ea3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70846","senseId":"1","lemma":"전화기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"전화기를","audio":"/audio/0fa5e90bf0e57d44b5d8.mp3"}},{"text":"잃어버렸니?","meaning":"丢，丢失，遗失","explanation":"잃어버리다：丢，丢失，遗失；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"잃어버리다","audio":"/audio/9cf9d89321e22dcf7c31.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68753","senseId":"1","lemma":"잃어버리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잃어버렸니","audio":"/audio/50578e9b0e8dad6581b5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"920d2edb72925038","term":"전화기","zh":"电话机","audio":"/audio/920d2edb729250383ea3.mp3","entryId":"70846","definition":"把说话声变成电波或电流发送出去，使相隔很远的人也可以互相对话的机器。","pronunciation":["전ː화기"]},{"id":"9cf9d89321e22dcf","term":"잃어버리다","zh":"丢，丢失，遗失","audio":"/audio/9cf9d89321e22dcf7c31.mp3","entryId":"68753","definition":"丢掉原本拥有的东西而不再拥有。","pronunciation":["이러버리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/2a615741b01b1a46ff03.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n90938-3-7-2","ko":"버스에서 내릴 때 자리에 떨군 것 같아.","zh":"应该是下公交车的时候掉在座位上了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"버스에서","meaning":"公共汽车，公交车","explanation":"버스：公共汽车，公交车；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"버스","audio":"/audio/fb84fa7f86eac62eca5f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36678","senseId":"1","lemma":"버스","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"버스에서","audio":"/audio/01284d8a699b7d1c8d9f.mp3"}},{"text":"내릴","meaning":"下，下去","explanation":"내리다：下，下去；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"내리다","audio":"/audio/01d776172b3f93c3c9d5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73353","senseId":"4","lemma":"내리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내릴","audio":"/audio/0ab84747094a8a5b53d5.mp3"}},{"text":"때","meaning":"时候","explanation":"때：时候。","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"5","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}},{"text":"자리에","meaning":"座位，席位","explanation":"자리：座位，席位；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"자리","audio":"/audio/0f4adfe312e61750897c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60332","senseId":"3","lemma":"자리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자리에","audio":"/audio/70904ab00b52ac53f12f.mp3"}},{"text":"떨군","meaning":"掉，丢","explanation":"떨구다：掉，丢；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"떨구다","audio":"/audio/c49a829e2d93727b16be.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"90938","senseId":"3","lemma":"떨구다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"떨군","audio":"/audio/f9cd4390e1461ef97456.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"东西，事，的","explanation":"것：东西，事，的。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"1","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같아","audio":"/audio/3eb21a4d72c48bbf26ae.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"fb84fa7f86eac62e","term":"버스","zh":"公共汽车，公交车","audio":"/audio/fb84fa7f86eac62eca5f.mp3","entryId":"36678","definition":"收取费用、按照规定路线行驶、可乘坐多人的大汽车。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"01d776172b3f93c3","term":"내리다","zh":"下，下去","audio":"/audio/01d776172b3f93c3c9d5.mp3","entryId":"73353","definition":"从乘坐的交通工具上出来而到某处。","pronunciation":["내리다"]},{"id":"43bc9c47e0f938b1","term":"때","zh":"时候","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3","entryId":"74123","definition":"在某种状况下。","pronunciation":["때"]},{"id":"0f4adfe312e61750","term":"자리","zh":"座位，席位","audio":"/audio/0f4adfe312e61750897c.mp3","entryId":"60332","definition":"供人坐的地方。","pronunciation":["자리"]},{"id":"c49a829e2d93727b","term":"떨구다","zh":"掉，丢","audio":"/audio/c49a829e2d93727b16be.mp3","entryId":"90938","definition":"弄丢或漏掉身上的东西。","pronunciation":["떨구다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"东西，事，的","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"泛指各种事物或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/842e921aea682c9fa8df.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.44,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=90938","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"고급","day":126,"sequenceScore":2.2667,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你在哪里弄丢手机了？","应该是下公交车的时候掉在座位上了。","手机挂饰真漂亮。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你在哪里弄丢手机了？","应该是下公交车的时候掉在座位上了。","手机挂饰真漂亮。"],"answer":1}]}
